{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03910","headline":"侍从途中口号应制 · 阎朝隐","name":"侍从途中口号应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疵贱出山东，忠贞任土风。\n因敷河朔藻，得奉洛阳宫。\n一顾侍御史，再顾给事中。\n常愿粉肌骨，特荅造化功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}